{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"他把自己收拾得挺拔，不让别人看出动摇\",\"source\":\"像一个人整理好衣服、抬起头，不让别人看见动摇\",\"type\":6,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把整理衣服、抬头作为自我控制的比喻，屏幕稿却把它写成了他实际做出的动作。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"那点高兴一退，他又酸起来\",\"source\":\"可那点高兴还没退，他心里就酸了\",\"type\":7,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿中高兴尚未消退时酸涩就已出现，屏幕稿改成高兴先消退、酸涩随后出现。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"等昂扬慢慢退潮，他又问\",\"source\":\"这股活动感也可以听成一次短暂的侧身离场；也可以听成前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮\",\"type\":7,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿提供的是两种并列的听法，屏幕稿用“等”把它们改成了先暂时离场、再逐渐退潮的先后过程。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"他又问：刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力相信\",\"source\":\"仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是用“仿佛”呈现一种可能的内心声音，屏幕稿将其写成了确定发生的自问。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"往事明明重要，却连重新讲一遍的力气都没有\",\"source\":\"这些轻弱、零碎的声音，也像一个疲倦的人在回想一件往事：明明知道它很重要，却已经没有力气把它重新讲述一遍\",\"type\":6,\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿把疲倦的人回想往事作为音乐意象，屏幕稿去掉比喻框架，使人像是真的没有力气重新讲述往事。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"这份挺立是经历动摇后的主动选择，不是假装从未受过伤\",\"source\":\"这份挺立也可以听成经历动摇后的主动选择：即使知道自己会犹疑、疲惫、想念，仍然可以决定怎样站立。它不要求人假装自己从未受过伤。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿将主动选择作为一种可供采用的音乐解读，屏幕稿却把它确定为这个人的实际心理选择和结论。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5c75178-dbb0-4c69-ba46-531216c2b22e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T174952360613Z", "elapsed_seconds": 509.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T17:58:21.855790+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64e5c2d955f61c98daf4c48faf45788259d8964a5b880574ab34679fa31fa01b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T174952360613Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "da7ebf2a53025c97196f7c0b97eea4901d4fffae6c1020ba344e3a6b0792b3be"}}}
